  "about": "Annual inspection, said area by area, with nothing found anywhere: interior, roof void, subfloor, exterior, fences and site all clear on a combination slab and timber floor house. Many conducive conditions: hot water overflow and air-con condensate onto the slab edge, garden beds over the weep holes, a dripping garden tap, stored timber on the dirt under the deck, poor subfloor ventilation. Tests that at most one NONE card is made and never one per area, that every conducive field is filled, that no treatment is recommended, and four mishearings.",
